      "text": [
        "Founded on the belief that every child deserves to feel understood",
        "Sensphere was founded by a specialist paediatric occupational therapist who spent years working across NHS, private and school settings and saw the same gap again and again: families waiting months for assessments, and schools left without the practical support they needed to help a child in front o",
        "We built Sensphere to close that gap; combining clinical rigour with a genuinely warm, child-led approach, and making sure that every report and every session translates into something families and teachers can actually use.",
        "HCPC Registered Occupational Therapists",
        "Enhanced DBS Checked"
      ]
