      "text": [
        "What parents and schools say about working with us",
        "\"The assessment gave us language for things we'd noticed for years but never understood. The report was clear enough to use straight away for our son's EHCP.\"",
        "\"Our therapist worked directly with class teachers to set up a sensory circuit before school starts. It's made a genuine difference to how settled the children feel.\"",
        "\"My daughter actually asks when her next session is. She's gone from refusing to hold a pencil to writing full sentences with confidence.\"",
        "Families Tell It Best",
        "SENCO, Primary School, Leeds"
